    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d26">

                <pb facs="0107" n="49" sameAs="frus:frus1866p3/pg49"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Translation.]</seg></opener>
                <head>Mr. Romero to Mr.
                        Seward</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Mexican Legation in the United States
                                of America, <hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Washington</hi>,</hi></placeName>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1865-12-30"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >December</hi> 30, 1865.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p>Mr. <hi rendition="#small-caps">Secretary:</hi> I have the honor to send you, for
                    the information of the United States government, the documents expressed in the
                    accompanying index, showing the state of affairs on the oriental line of the
                    Mexican republic, including the States of Vera Cruz, Tlaxcala Puebla, Oaxaca,
                    Tabasco, and Chiapas.</p>
                <p>In these documents you will find despatches from General Garcia, chief of the
                    said line; from the governor of the State of Chiapas; and a very important
                    report of General Baranda, commissioner of General Garcia.</p>
                <p>I accept this opportunity to renew to you, Mr. Secretary, the assurances of my
                    most distinguished consideration.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>M. ROMERO</signed></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>Hon. <hi rendition="#small-caps">William</hi> H. <hi rendition="#small-caps"
                            >Seward, <hi rendition="#italic">&amp;c., &amp;c., &amp;c.</hi></hi></p>
                </postscript>


                <xi:include href="d26-a1.xml" xpointer="d26-a1"/>
